<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 628.30, up 2.33.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.08.</p>
<p>Advances beat declines 333 to 214.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 26,949,010 compared with 23,091,340 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
</text>
